# Ideal free-standing graphene, a=2.461 angstrom and 13.23 angstrom cell height.
lattice Hexagonal 4.651 25
coords-type lattice
ion C 0 0 0 0
ion C 0.3333333333333333 -0.3333333333333333 0 0
include results/pseudo.in
coulomb-interaction Slab 001
coulomb-truncation-embed 0 0 0
spintype no-spin
elec-ex-corr gga-PBE
elec-cutoff 30
elec-n-bands 16
elec-smearing Fermi 0.002
